WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.434 --> 00:00:03.975
Unit ten. Understanding Downloads!

2
00:00:04.903 --> 00:00:09.321
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.371 --> 00:00:13.263
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:17.561
Today we learn about Understanding Downloads. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.595 --> 00:00:22.728
Download. Say it with me. Download!

6
00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:30.144
File. Say it with me. File!

7
00:00:33.661 --> 00:00:37.526
Internet. Say it with me. Internet!

8
00:00:41.023 --> 00:00:44.714
Save. Say it with me. Save!

9
00:00:48.219 --> 00:00:52.952
Progress bar. Say it with me. Progress bar!

10
00:00:56.420 --> 00:01:00.154
Complete. Say it with me. Complete!

11
00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:07.697
Storage. Say it with me. Storage!

12
00:01:11.197 --> 00:01:16.030
Trusted source. Say it with me. Trusted source!

13
00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:30.124
Downloading means saving a file from the internet to my device. A progress bar shows when it's complete. I only download from a trusted source.

14
00:01:30.174 --> 00:01:33.453
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:39.880
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:41.129
Internet!

17
00:01:42.198 --> 00:01:47.468
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.518 --> 00:01:48.668
Storage!

19
00:01:49.772 --> 00:01:57.868
Did you know? A download's progress bar shows you exactly how much of the file has been transferred so far!

20
00:01:57.918 --> 00:02:00.405
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:01.257 --> 00:02:11.296
Think and answer. Why is it important to only download files from a trusted source?

22
00:02:11.346 --> 00:02:12.527
Great answer!

23
00:02:13.458 --> 00:02:19.244
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:19.294 --> 00:02:22.569
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

